Vendor marks in the web UI
--------------------------

The Model providers screen shows a small mark beside each provider so a row
can be told apart at a glance. The artwork for those marks comes from the
Simple Icons project (https://simpleicons.org), whose SVG path data is
released under the CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The files live in
web/src/components/icons.tsx.

CC0 covers the drawing, not the trademark. Each mark is a trademark or
registered trademark of its owner, and appears here only to identify that
vendor's service. Nothing in this repository claims any right to the marks
or implies endorsement by their owners.

Marks in the icon set, and whose they are:

  - Claude — Anthropic, shown on the built-in Anthropic row
  - DeepSeek — DeepSeek, shown on the DeepSeek preset
  - Alibaba Cloud — Alibaba, shown on the Alibaba (Qwen) preset
  - Qwen — Alibaba, in the icon set for that same preset; not on screen today

Vendors shown by name only, with a neutral lettermark in place of a logo:

  - OpenAI
  - Z.AI

